    "long_instructions": "You’re a QA engineer testing a program for a robot vacuum cleaner. The program keeps track of a number representing where it is. The program updates the number to move right or left, but there’s a bug.\r\n\r\n**Do This**\r\n\r\n1. Try to run the code!\r\n2. Read the error message. Use the error message to identify the bug in the program.\r\n3. Fix the bug and run the program again.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nIf you’re having trouble understanding an error message, you can copy the message into the AI Tutor to ask for help.\r\n",
